program	errors/any_unsized_binding.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	`any Shape` is unsized and cannot be used by value here
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: `any Shape` is unsized and cannot be used by value here"
log	"  --> examples/errors/any_unsized_binding.saw:17:5"
log	"     |"
log	" 17 |     let x: any Shape = c"
log	"     |     ^"
log	"   hint: an erased value is legal only behind explicit ownership: `&any Shape` (borrowed) or `Box<any Shape>` (owned) — design 51"
log	""
log	"error: cannot assign `Circle` to variable of type `any Shape`"
log	"  --> examples/errors/any_unsized_binding.saw:17:5"
log	"     |"
log	" 17 |     let x: any Shape = c"
log	"     |     ^"
log	""
log	"2 error(s) generated"
